{"data":[{"author_id":"925446092669489154","created_at":"2026-10-13T02:06:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109827994738946518"],"id":"2109827994738946518","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":40,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"大多数人学缠论，第一步就走错了。\n\n他们把它当成「预测」工具，想提前算出明天是涨还是跌。\n\n错了。\n\n缠论的本质是「分类」，不是「预测」。\n\n缠中说禅最狠的一句话：走势必完美。\n\n任何一段走势，不管是盘整还是趋势，最终一定会把它的结构走完。所以你不必去猜方向，只要认出它现在走到了哪一步。","url":"https://x.com/InGodWeBelieveU/status/2109827994738946518"},{"author_id":"925446092669489154","created_at":"2026-10-12T19:29:52.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109728277913035194"],"id":"2109728277913035194","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":122,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"text":"散户学缠论最大的误区：以为它是拿来「预测」的。\n\n缠论从不预测，它只做一件事——给走势归类。\n\n上涨、下跌、盘整，任何行情都逃不出这三类。\n你要判断的不是明天涨还是跌，而是：\n\n现在这一段，走完了没有？\n\n判断看两点：\n① 有没有出现背驰——力度衰竭；\n② 中枢是被离开，还是被回落。\n\n背驰出现 +","url":"https://x.com/InGodWeBelieveU/status/2109728277913035194"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109577959132766208"]},"author_id":"1592938896161001472","created_at":"2026-10-12T09:32:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109577984235667951"],"id":"2109577984235667951","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":42,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"感受行情起落的博弈魅力\n市场博弈人性的恐惧与贪婪\n真正的高手，短线长线随心切换\n但核心杀手锏依旧是风控+仓位管理\n它们远比买卖点更为重要！\n十月操盘手训练营报名进行中~\n今晚19:00全网缠论公开课\n缠论拆解当下走势分类与买卖点\n锁定每周一三五免费公开课\n直播地址：微博关注《高山说缠论》 https://t.co/XmWYm0JI7s","url":"https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2109577984235667951"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109794649821138944","3_2109794898446888960","3_2109795098171207680"]},"author_id":"1910907485554462720","created_at":"2026-10-12T23:56:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109795257554702701"],"id":"2109795257554702701","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":2237,"like_count":14,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":3},"text":"昨天两点广场＆腾讯会议内部直播说这里有潜在30min3卖预期\n\n去5min定位2卖去做空\n时隔一天 三卖正在进行中\n\n不知道那些说缠论复盘有用，实盘没用的小伙伴有啥感想~ https://t.co/cgWVcnqaiM","url":"https://x.com/Cycle_King1913/status/2109795257554702701"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109960477623402496"]},"author_id":"1495253346311020545","created_at":"2026-10-13T11:01:18.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109962680643809627"],"id":"2109962680643809627","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":6616,"like_count":23,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":19,"retweet_count":2},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109941403749118277","type":"quoted"}],"text":"比特币 12 小时往上的收敛结构没有完成\n\n因为没有向上闭合，这更加意味着日线级别还是一个空的状态。\n\n从缠论的结构来分析，目前高位整理的框架可以用一个中枢来解释：\n\n1. 75000 这个价位就是这个中枢的下沿；\n\n2. 87395 就是它的上沿。 https://t.co/hfNSHfmxqC https://t.co/JNqX7LGmPa","url":"https://x.com/zfcbtc/status/2109962680643809627"},{"article":{"title":"正常人可不可以偶尔透析，可以让肾脏功能更好、排毒效果更好吗？"},"author_id":"1715475430336061440","created_at":"2026-10-13T09:38:31.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109941846260494792"],"id":"2109941846260494792","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":46,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"网友问：正常人可不可以偶尔透析，可以让肾脏功能更好、排毒效果更好吗？ 不可以，方向正好反了。 https://t.co/uMOeHc8gsN","url":"https://x.com/laoyue1991/status/2109941846260494792"},{"article":{"title":"六十甲子日柱系列 - 乙亥"},"author_id":"935001155570057217","created_at":"2026-10-12T14:11:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109648134531916093"],"id":"2109648134531916093","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":408,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"https://t.co/DdQ2LBheli","url":"https://x.com/wangzuobazi01/status/2109648134531916093"},{"article":{"title":"《1101宿舍私密日记（双x）》"},"author_id":"146860563","created_at":"2026-10-12T17:17:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109695061076447321"],"id":"2109695061076447321","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":68,"impression_count":22995,"like_count":184,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":11},"text":"https://t.co/ehCaG7WlAx","url":"https://x.com/Cizarrin/status/2109695061076447321"},{"author_id":"2108505586526740480","created_at":"2026-10-12T15:08:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109662582168834100"],"id":"2109662582168834100","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":10,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"禅","url":"https://x.com/yongfreeg8/status/2109662582168834100"},{"author_id":"1316966018674089985","created_at":"2026-10-12T11:09:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109602449845834105"],"id":"2109602449845834105","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":9,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"【po文+po18+废文+AO3】合集\n\n🔗：资源链接请看我主页介绍\n\n《出租屋》作者：匿名咸鱼-27\n《双胞胎怎么这么多！》作者：电眼猫头鹰-21\n《开局成为地下城boss》作者：哼哼hengheng-442\n《恶人难磨》作者：少年先锋队-186\n《我的狗》作者：匿名咸鱼-19\n《晕倒羊的生存守则》作者：开樽-62","url":"https://x.com/kenclothing1/status/2109602449845834105"},{"author_id":"2108505586526740480","created_at":"2026-10-13T05:13:50.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109875236929929365"],"id":"2109875236929929365","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"《修定与参禅证道》文章摘录\n\n第六章     禅定与见道的关系","url":"https://x.com/yongfreeg8/status/2109875236929929365"},{"article":{"title":"鲁迅：在铁屋子里呐喊的人"},"author_id":"2869390354","created_at":"2026-10-13T09:21:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109937605890740432"],"id":"2109937605890740432","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3127,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"text":"https://t.co/5tawWubT39","url":"https://x.com/jhdxhl/status/2109937605890740432"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109615945216106496"]},"author_id":"2073035346707968000","created_at":"2026-10-12T12:06:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109616749520052237"],"id":"2109616749520052237","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":7,"impression_count":3141,"like_count":22,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":1},"text":"开启zen模式，去做两小时数学。按小克老师说的“数禅.自我” @keking99 \n\n看到评论区有人想先看gan，我刚好去年写过gan的解析，先拿它找找手感先😅。\n\n网站还在制作中，估计得等个几天。 https://t.co/G60JGfBC6V","url":"https://x.com/yifanxu_ephai/status/2109616749520052237"},{"author_id":"1452505528106569729","created_at":"2026-10-12T14:21:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109650545652969574"],"id":"2109650545652969574","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":12408,"like_count":25,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":1},"text":"给大家科普一下：\n\n金庸小说里有个人，叫岳不群。\n\n这个人特别牛逼，江湖人称「君子剑」，天天满嘴仁义道德，一副正人君子的模样。\n\n但是岳不群一直有一个梦想：\n\n成为天下第一，实现弯道超车。\n\n后来偷偷搞到了林家的《辟邪剑谱》，结果发现一个惊天秘密：\n\n欲练神功，必先自宫。\n\n卧槽，卧槽，卧槽。","url":"https://x.com/xiaoshunli/status/2109650545652969574"},{"author_id":"1852592574751756288","created_at":"2026-10-13T01:28:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109818419885514920"],"id":"2109818419885514920","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":7,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"想学习缠论，有没有好点的股票缠论书籍或课程推荐的？","url":"https://x.com/will980706/status/2109818419885514920"},{"author_id":"2108505586526740480","created_at":"2026-10-12T14:42:30.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109655957676683661"],"id":"2109655957676683661","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":11,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"📖诵读练习","url":"https://x.com/yongfreeg8/status/2109655957676683661"},{"article":{"title":"禅宗：一个说\"不立文字\"、却留下了最多文字的宗派"},"author_id":"2869390354","created_at":"2026-10-12T07:30:33.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109547252855476258"],"id":"2109547252855476258","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4048,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"https://t.co/RkSfNSGOhd","url":"https://x.com/jhdxhl/status/2109547252855476258"},{"author_id":"2108505586526740480","created_at":"2026-10-13T05:36:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109880918601261343"],"id":"2109880918601261343","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":17,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"【莫轻园头】\n\n   　有一学僧向洛浦禅师告假辞行，想到其它地方去参学，洛浦禅师就问道：\n\n　　“此处四面是山，你要往何处去？”\n\n　　学僧哑口不知如何回答。\n\n　　洛浦禅师道：“如果你在十天内能够回答，那就请便！”","url":"https://x.com/yongfreeg8/status/2109880918601261343"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109742828738002944"]},"author_id":"1536613494715404288","created_at":"2026-10-12T20:29:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109743162428363128"],"id":"2109743162428363128","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":71,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"最近沉迷于缠论，结构出来自带K线美学啊。自己开发了一个缠论的变种。#K线美学 #缠论 https://t.co/emnzf0jSmp","url":"https://x.com/GalenJoe2/status/2109743162428363128"},{"author_id":"925446092669489154","created_at":"2026-10-13T04:13:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109859938671509530"],"id":"2109859938671509530","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":46,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"缠论 · 画线之前先\"合并\"K线\n\n缠论画线的第一步，\n不是画线，是\"合并\"K线。\n\n不合并，分型就认不准。\n\n「后一根K线完全落在前一根的高低范围内，就叫包含」\n\n处理办法：\n向上走时，高点取更高，低点取更高；\n向下走时，高点取更低，低点取更低。\n\n示意（数字为虚构，只演示规则）：\n\nK1｜高 𝟭𝟬　低","url":"https://x.com/InGodWeBelieveU/status/2109859938671509530"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109443649356673024","3_2109443649327312896"]},"author_id":"1687661863193264128","created_at":"2026-10-12T00:38:55.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109443661218066495"],"id":"2109443661218066495","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":145,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"凌晨的暴跌洗盘刚结束，比特币现在又悄悄摸回了 83,840 附近。看了下盘面，多空博弈非常精彩！\n🔴 【15分钟线】：MACD水下金叉后红柱持续放量，均线多头排列，短线明显有资金在托底。24小时高点 84,200 是短期需要突破的阻力。\n🔵 https://t.co/id73sWVLFF","url":"https://x.com/lxp720803/status/2109443661218066495"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109820276737548288"]},"author_id":"1592938896161001472","created_at":"2026-10-13T01:36:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109820427375935544"],"id":"2109820427375935544","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":30,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"10月操盘手训练营课程报名进行中，本期训练营重点围绕缠论基础进阶教学进行，让基础比较薄弱的同学逐步形成稳定的缠论操作体系，并有大量实战操作并行，在市场经济里，只要有好的心态与技术，就可以战胜一切。欢迎大家报名学习~\n\n#缠论交易体系教学 https://t.co/unzsQic7bY","url":"https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2109820427375935544"},{"author_id":"1646964117763235840","created_at":"2026-10-12T03:01:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109479437553316138"],"id":"2109479437553316138","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1343,"like_count":13,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109312609694691601","type":"quoted"}],"text":"研究缠论还是挺有帮助。我也就学了点皮毛，至少对大趋势的理解很有帮助。现在有了AI，让AI辅助你理解。\n缠论整个体系归根结底：\n价格什么时候在“缠”（震荡），什么时候在“不缠”（趋势）。 https://t.co/gaSoXackZB","url":"https://x.com/ErikWilcox91338/status/2109479437553316138"},{"author_id":"1592938896161001472","created_at":"2026-10-13T01:10:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109813918654984528"],"id":"2109813918654984528","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":37,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"《高山说缠》-今日早课之缠论解析10.13 https://t.co/WswZJqQnqA 来自 @YouTube","url":"https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2109813918654984528"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2109981864463302656"]},"author_id":"1709608733418930180","created_at":"2026-10-13T12:17:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109981901104861418"],"id":"2109981901104861418","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"#缠论 交易员日常。 https://t.co/O8HxCrhL4Y","url":"https://x.com/wngzhngchn69881/status/2109981901104861418"}],"includes":{"media":[{"media_key":"3_2109577959132766208","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2109794649821138944","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2109794898446888960","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2109795098171207680","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2109960477623402496","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2109615945216106496","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2109742828738002944","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2109443649356673024","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2109443649327312896","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2109820276737548288","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"13_2109981864463302656","type":"video"}],"users":[{"id":"925446092669489154","name":"Peter Liu, PhD｜Wealth & Wellness","username":"InGodWeBelieveU"},{"id":"1592938896161001472","name":"Crypto以缠解势","username":"yycl_gaoshan"},{"id":"1910907485554462720","name":"花解周期（退休养老版）","username":"Cycle_King1913"},{"id":"1495253346311020545","name":"张发财 | 🅱️BTC","username":"zfcbtc"},{"id":"1715475430336061440","name":"岳医生","username":"laoyue1991"},{"id":"935001155570057217","name":"王佐","username":"wangzuobazi01"},{"id":"146860563","name":"白萝卜不白","username":"Cizarrin"},{"id":"2108505586526740480","name":"孟橄榄","username":"yongfreeg8"},{"id":"1316966018674089985","name":"kenclothingco.","username":"kenclothing1"},{"id":"2869390354","name":"Fox","username":"jhdxhl"},{"id":"2073035346707968000","name":"Yifan Xu","username":"yifanxu_ephai"},{"id":"1452505528106569729","name":"大顺利","username":"xiaoshunli"},{"id":"1852592574751756288","name":"will980706","username":"will980706"},{"id":"1536613494715404288","name":"微神🇭🇰","username":"GalenJoe2"},{"id":"1687661863193264128","name":"唯铭.李","username":"lxp720803"},{"id":"1646964117763235840","name":"新的希望","username":"ErikWilcox91338"},{"id":"1709608733418930180","name":"万事皆随我愿","username":"wngzhngchn69881"}]},"meta":{"newest_id":"2109981901104861418","next_token":"b26v89c19zqg8o3juzizkssk67rql1v7zeoyy4u8l47lp","oldest_id":"2109443661218066495","result_count":25}}
